# Ducal Hospitality (jeuno 68): the available check's operands one at a time, at Taillegeas (default 10061). A level 75
# Warrior, CoP The Road Forks current, Jeuno fame level 3 ((150 + 150 + 148) / 2 = 224): 10061 (no section); Windurst
# 150 (a GM; 225, level 4): 10057, option 10; a Goblin Pie traded while the quest is only available: no onTrade:
# nothing. CoP A Vessel Without a Captain current (318: not completed; a GM, The Road Forks completed first: addMission
# refuses to overwrite a current mission): 10061.
lists RuludeGardens/Taillegeas/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Taillegeas/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10057
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=29.5,2,58 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 150
fame Bastok 150
fame Windurst 148
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
item GoblinPie
login
trigger Taillegeas                      # fame level 3: no section; 10061
finish
fame Windurst 150                       # a GM: level 4
trigger Taillegeas                      # 10057, a draw
finish option=10                        # not begun
trade Taillegeas GoblinPie x1           # available: no onTrade: nothing (the pie kept)
mission Cop TheRoadForks completed      # a GM: the log's current mission cleared
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain current # a GM: 318 current, not completed
trigger Taillegeas                      # no section; 10061
finish
